sequenceDiagram
    participant Client as External Client
    participant Gateway as Istio Gateway Proxy<br/>443/TCP HTTPS TLS 1.2+
    participant Authorino as Kuadrant/Authorino<br/>AuthPolicy Evaluation
    participant MaaSAPI as maas-api (per-tenant)<br/>8443/TCP HTTPS TLS
    participant ModelBackend as Model Backend<br/>(KServe/ExternalModel)<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
    participant Admin as Platform Admin
    participant K8sAPI as Kubernetes API<br/>6443/TCP HTTPS TLS 1.2+
    participant Controller as maas-controller<br/>8081/TCP Health
    participant PostgreSQL as PostgreSQL<br/>5432/TCP

    rect rgb(230, 245, 255)
        Note over Client,ModelBackend: Flow 1: Model Inference Request (API Key Authentication)

        Client->>Gateway: POST /v1/models/model:predict<br/>Auth: Bearer sk-oai-* API key
        Gateway->>Authorino: Evaluate AuthPolicy<br/>(API key plain selector)
        Authorino->>MaaSAPI: POST /internal/v1/api-keys/validate<br/>HTTPS callback
        MaaSAPI->>PostgreSQL: Validate API key<br/>TCP :5432
        PostgreSQL-->>MaaSAPI: Key valid + metadata
        MaaSAPI-->>Authorino: 200 OK (key validated)
        Note over Authorino: Strips Authorization header<br/>Injects X-MaaS-Username,<br/>X-MaaS-Group,<br/>X-MaaS-Subscription
        Authorino-->>Gateway: Auth success + identity headers
        Gateway->>ModelBackend: Forward request<br/>HTTPS TLS 1.2+<br/>Per-model credentialRef
        ModelBackend-->>Gateway: Inference response
        Gateway-->>Client: JSON Response
    end

    rect rgb(255, 243, 224)
        Note over Admin,Controller: Flow 2: Tenant Bootstrap (AITenant Reconciliation)

        Admin->>K8sAPI: Create AITenant CR<br/>kubectl apply
        K8sAPI->>Controller: Watch event: AITenant created
        Controller->>K8sAPI: Create tenant Namespace
        Controller->>K8sAPI: Create MaasTenantConfig
        Controller->>K8sAPI: Render & apply maas-api<br/>Deployment, Service, RBAC,<br/>NetworkPolicies (kustomize)
        Controller->>K8sAPI: Create HTTPRoute<br/>(Gateway API routing)
        Controller->>K8sAPI: Create AuthPolicy<br/>(Kuadrant authentication)
        Controller->>K8sAPI: Create DestinationRule<br/>(Istio TLS enforcement)
        Note over Controller: Per-tenant maas-api<br/>instance now running<br/>with dedicated routing
    end
